<title>SINGAPORE: Pan-United wins S$66 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Pan-United wins S$66 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pan-United Corp Ltd said on Monday its shipyard subsidiary has won two contracts worth about Singapore $66 million to build two double-hulled tankers for use by Indonesian oil company Pertamina.</p>
</text>
